<title>UK: Rand Mines still mulling buy offer.</title>
<headline>Rand Mines still mulling buy offer.</headline>
<dateline>LONDON 1997-01-22</dateline>
<text>
<p>Rand Mines Ltd, also known as Rand Mines New, said on Wednesday its directors were still considering a proposal put to the company which could include an offer for its ordinary shares.</p>
<p>In a statement made via UAL Merchant Bank Ltd to the London and Johannesburg stock exchanges, the South African company said its shareholders were advised to continue to exercise caution in dealing in its shares until a further announcement is published.</p>
<p>The firm disclosed it was in talks on December 19 last year.</p>
<p>-- London Newsroom +44 171 542 7717</p>
</text>
